      "content": "it's just too quiet here. i thought i wanted this, to just be away from everyone and everything, but now it feels like the walls are actually getting closer every day. i've built this life to be safe, but i feel more trapped in here than i ever did out there. i don't see a way to fix it. there's just no way out.",
