      "content": "it's not just monotony though. it's like... there's nothing left of me to actually reconnect with. i've spent so long being alone that i feel empty. everything i try to do to \"fix\" it just feels like a lie. it feels like i'm just performing being a person. there's no light at the end of this, just more of the same silence. i'm just tired of fighting to exist in a cage i built myself.",
